Tokilog Third-Party Notices

This file lists third-party components used by Tokilog alpha binary
distributions: the CLI assets (`tokilog-cli-net10.0-*.zip`) and the Desktop
GUI assets (`tokilog-desktop-net10.0-*.zip`). Third-party components are
licensed by their respective copyright holders. Tokilog's Alpha Evaluation
License does not replace or modify these third-party licenses.

Tokilog alpha binaries are framework-dependent .NET applications (published
with `--self-contained false`). The .NET Runtime itself is not redistributed
in the Tokilog zip assets; users install the .NET Runtime separately.

Components marked [CLI] are used by the CLI assets, [Desktop] by the Desktop
GUI assets, and [CLI, Desktop] by both. Platform-specific native asset
packages are included only in the assets for the matching platform.


